1
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:02,830


2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

3
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

4
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

5
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

6
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

7
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

8
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

9
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

10
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

11
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

12
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

13
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

14
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

15
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

16
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

17
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

18
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

19
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

20
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

21
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

22
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

23
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

24
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

25
00:01:58,400 --> 00:02:01,360
Planet Tian Yun\NAlliance Star System

26
00:01:58,480 --> 00:02:00,400
Planet Tian Yun's spiritual energy is so dense

27
00:02:00,600 --> 00:02:01,880
that it's overflowing.

28
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:05,120
Planet Suzaku is not even comparable to it.

29
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:08,560
Many powerful cultivators must live on it.

30
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:10,920
To avoid being found out as an Ancient God,

31
00:02:11,320 --> 00:02:13,520
my original body will stay hidden.

32
00:02:23,040 --> 00:02:24,240
There seems to be

33
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:26,480
some kind of destructive energy in this mist.

34
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:28,640
If I recklessly charge in,

35
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:30,800
it will attack me relentlessly.

36
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:39,240
I'm looking for Senior All-Seer.

37
00:02:44,160 --> 00:02:45,480
Fellow cultivator, come in.

38
00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:47,800
Master has been expecting you.

39
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:57,040
I never told anyone where I was going.

40
00:02:57,760 --> 00:02:59,520
Could it be that Senior All-Seer

41
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:01,680
possesses divination abilities

42
00:03:02,040 --> 00:03:03,760
and calculated my arrival today ?

43
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:07,560
Heavenly Fate Sect

44
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:10,840
Wang Lin of planet Suzaku

45
00:03:10,880 --> 00:03:12,680
requests an audience with Senior All-Seer.

46
00:03:15,480 --> 00:03:18,440
Zhao Xingsha\NMiddle stage Soul Transformation\NHeavenly Fate Sect Purple Division disciple

47
00:03:15,480 --> 00:03:16,400
Master,

48
00:03:16,440 --> 00:03:17,950
this person is just an honorary disciple,

49
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:19,840
why do you want him to take the trials ?

50
00:03:21,200 --> 00:03:23,410
Back then, I took him as disciple on a whim

51
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:26,240
so it created a seed of karma for our relation.

52
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:28,400
I didn't expect that in just 100 years,

53
00:03:28,640 --> 00:03:30,600
he would've already reached this stage.

54
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:33,800
He isn't simple...

55
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:37,400
He has good fortune

56
00:03:37,600 --> 00:03:39,160
to have caught Master's eye.

57
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:41,600
If he passes the 3 trials,

58
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:43,840
take him to the Purple Cloud Pavilion.

59
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:48,840
Zhou Wan\NMiddle stage Soul Transformation\NHeavenly Fate Sect Purple Division disciple

60
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:47,680
Is a native from a wasted planet

61
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:49,520
worthy of Master's teachings ?

62
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:51,480
Master values talent.

63
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:53,640
If this Wang Lin is extraordinary,

64
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:55,040
taking him as a disciple

65
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:56,520
is only natural.

66
00:03:57,840 --> 00:03:59,040
Junior Brother Sun Yun,

67
00:03:59,320 --> 00:04:02,120
it seems Master has really lost all faith in you…

68
00:04:03,040 --> 00:04:03,640
Wang Lin,

69
00:04:04,440 --> 00:04:05,920
if you want to see Master,

70
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:08,120
you'll have to undergo the 3 trials.

71
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:09,400
Do you dare to try ?

72
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:11,800
Why wouldn't I ?

73
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:18,040
The Human Trial

74
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:20,160
tests the Dao Heart.

75
00:04:22,960 --> 00:04:26,290
Human Trial

76
00:04:22,840 --> 00:04:23,960
How is

77
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:26,080
the Dao Heart tested ?

78
00:04:33,320 --> 00:04:34,160
Wan'er...

79
00:04:36,760 --> 00:04:38,400
So it uses the heart's desires

80
00:04:38,840 --> 00:04:41,240
to manifest illusions.

81
00:04:41,440 --> 00:04:43,960
But how does one pass the Human Trial ?

82
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:45,120
This trial isn't difficult.

83
00:04:45,320 --> 00:04:46,760
Whether you calm your heart

84
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:48,320
or slash through the illusion,

85
00:04:48,360 --> 00:04:49,600
the trial will be cleared.

86
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:51,160
But Senior Brother,

87
00:04:51,440 --> 00:04:54,080
do you know what Sun Yun did back then ?

88
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:58,120
He chose to seek the Dao.

89
00:04:58,840 --> 00:05:02,000
Sun Yun became Master's direct disciple of the Purple Division.

90
00:05:02,080 --> 00:05:03,680
He really was a genius.

91
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:07,600
How many geniuses like Sun Yun are there in this world ?

92
00:05:21,360 --> 00:05:22,040
Tie Zhu !

93
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:24,180
Father,

94
00:05:24,200 --> 00:05:24,720
Mother.

95
00:05:25,760 --> 00:05:27,920
We are going to the mountains.

96
00:05:28,520 --> 00:05:29,920
Is it just the two of you ?

97
00:05:30,320 --> 00:05:31,360
Will you be safe ?

98
00:05:31,840 --> 00:05:32,720
It's fine,

99
00:05:32,760 --> 00:05:35,040
many people from the village are going together.

100
00:05:35,880 --> 00:05:36,360
Right.

101
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:38,420
If we're lucky,

102
00:05:38,440 --> 00:05:39,900
we might even get a roe deer pelt

103
00:05:39,920 --> 00:05:41,030
to make a jacket.

104
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:43,120
Tie Zhu,

105
00:05:43,840 --> 00:05:45,200
what are you carving ?

106
00:05:48,640 --> 00:05:49,320
Yes...

107
00:05:50,440 --> 00:05:51,600
What am I carving ?

108
00:05:52,880 --> 00:05:54,440
Why can't I remember ?

109
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:57,000
I only remember

110
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:59,520
that it was something very important.

111
00:05:59,640 --> 00:06:01,690
I don't want to let go of this obsession.

112
00:06:01,080 --> 00:06:02,120
Something's happened !

113
00:06:02,680 --> 00:06:04,440
A tiger has killed people !

114
00:06:10,080 --> 00:06:10,880
Dead...

115
00:06:10,880 --> 00:06:11,960
They're all dead...

116
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,640
They were fine when they left...

117
00:06:15,480 --> 00:06:15,880
Father...

118
00:06:15,880 --> 00:06:16,760
How did this happen ?

119
00:06:17,440 --> 00:06:18,000
Mother...

120
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:29,880
So that's what

121
00:06:30,400 --> 00:06:31,600
the Human Trial is...

122
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:32,950
Tie Zhu !

123
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:34,150
Each time my wood carving breaks,

124
00:06:34,200 --> 00:06:35,560
the cycle starts again.

125
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:37,960
And the cycles are endless...

126
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:39,240
Every time,

127
00:06:39,320 --> 00:06:41,680
they leave me in the same way.

128
00:06:42,400 --> 00:06:44,280
Since you have seen through it,

129
00:06:44,640 --> 00:06:47,600
why didn't you break the illusion to come out ?

130
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:50,640
You can't build without breaking.

131
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:52,400
Break it and recreate it.

132
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:54,120
Major destruction leads to major creation.

133
00:06:54,640 --> 00:06:56,720
Dawn is a metaphor of rebirth.

134
00:06:59,320 --> 00:07:00,280
Rebirth...

135
00:07:00,760 --> 00:07:01,440
What's old ?

136
00:07:02,280 --> 00:07:03,280
What's new ?

137
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:07,160
The 84th cycle is about to begin.

138
00:07:08,200 --> 00:07:10,600
Are you sure you want to continue ?

139
00:07:12,640 --> 00:07:13,160
Of course.

140
00:07:15,440 --> 00:07:16,760
This child

141
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,280
is really good...

142
00:07:19,280 --> 00:07:21,680
The Human Trial that I made

143
00:07:22,400 --> 00:07:24,080
may be called a trial

144
00:07:24,440 --> 00:07:26,440
but is in reality an opportunity.

145
00:07:26,880 --> 00:07:29,680
If one seeks the Dao during the trial,

146
00:07:30,280 --> 00:07:32,960
the Dao Heart will become indestructible.

147
00:07:35,720 --> 00:07:38,920
Sun Yun only sought of the Dao for 67 days back then.

148
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:40,080
Senior Brother,

149
00:07:40,320 --> 00:07:41,600
this child is bad news.

150
00:07:41,960 --> 00:07:42,760
Maybe...

151
00:07:56,840 --> 00:07:58,020
No matter who you are,

152
00:07:58,080 --> 00:07:58,840
get out !

153
00:08:23,360 --> 00:08:24,960
The true meaning of the Human Trial

154
00:08:25,080 --> 00:08:27,120
is to seek the Dao with your heart.

155
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:34,400
Being yourself

156
00:08:34,440 --> 00:08:36,440
and not fearing your true heart.

157
00:08:38,040 --> 00:08:39,480
Not rejecting your heart

158
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:41,760
is the true meaning of freedom.

159
00:08:47,320 --> 00:08:49,880
Earth Trial

160
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:51,880
I'm the guardian of the Earth Trial.

161
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:53,520
Defeat me,

162
00:08:54,160 --> 00:08:56,120
and you may continue.

163
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:05,920
It seems that the number of guardians I can defeat

164
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:08,240
is used to gauge the strength of my cultivation.

165
00:09:09,040 --> 00:09:10,520
Someone's been spying on me.

166
00:09:11,040 --> 00:09:13,080
These Earth Trial and Heaven Trial

167
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:14,840
might be dangerous.

168
00:09:15,880 --> 00:09:16,480
I give up

169
00:09:16,920 --> 00:09:17,680
the Earth Trial.

170
00:09:19,560 --> 00:09:21,000
Quite clever.

171
00:09:21,680 --> 00:09:23,360
If you dared to continue,

172
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:26,280
I would've used this opportunity to kill you.

173
00:09:28,320 --> 00:09:29,840
At least now,

174
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:33,280
you've lost your qualification to become a disciple.

175
00:09:33,520 --> 00:09:34,160
Stop it.

176
00:09:37,640 --> 00:09:38,720
Master's order.

177
00:09:41,280 --> 00:09:42,440
What !?

178
00:09:43,400 --> 00:09:46,320
Heaven Trial

179
00:09:48,640 --> 00:09:49,640
The Heaven Trial

180
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:52,040
tests the domain.

181
00:09:56,640 --> 00:09:57,640
I got so far

182
00:09:58,360 --> 00:10:01,840
by making a domain with a small part of a heavenly Dao

183
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:04,440
that I was able to understand.

184
00:10:05,520 --> 00:10:08,920
Can the All-Seer manifest the root of that heavenly Dao ?

185
00:10:09,280 --> 00:10:11,680
What kind of power does he possess ?

186
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:16,040
But I don't want this experience

187
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:18,600
to sabotage my domain.

188
00:10:26,880 --> 00:10:27,640
I give up

189
00:10:28,400 --> 00:10:29,200
the Heaven Trial.

190
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:42,040
Junior Brother Wang Lin,

191
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:43,400
I am Zhao Xingsha.

192
00:10:43,880 --> 00:10:45,440
Since I entered the sect earlier,

193
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:47,000
you may call me Senior Brother.

194
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:48,840
Greetings, Senior Brother.

195
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:51,400
Junior Brother, follow me.

196
00:10:51,520 --> 00:10:52,920
Master has instructed me

197
00:10:53,160 --> 00:10:55,280
to guide you to the Purple Cloud Pavilion.

198
00:11:01,560 --> 00:11:02,360
Senior Brother,

199
00:11:02,840 --> 00:11:04,190
how many disciples

200
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:05,680
does Senior All-Seer have ?

201
00:11:06,280 --> 00:11:07,440
The Master's disciples

202
00:11:07,800 --> 00:11:09,360
are all categorized by 7 colors.

203
00:11:09,960 --> 00:11:11,550
Just our Purple Division

204
00:11:11,640 --> 00:11:13,560
has over a million disciples.

205
00:11:17,640 --> 00:11:18,640
This is

206
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:20,880
the Purple Division of the Heavenly Fate Sect.

207
00:11:24,280 --> 00:11:25,840
Among the 7 divisions,

208
00:11:25,880 --> 00:11:28,160
our Purple Division is the weakest.

209
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:30,560
You will understand why

210
00:11:30,640 --> 00:11:31,960
very quickly.

211
00:11:33,040 --> 00:11:34,120
Junior Brother Wang Lin,

212
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:35,600
go west from here

213
00:11:35,680 --> 00:11:37,120
to the Purple Cloud Pavilion.

214
00:11:37,520 --> 00:11:39,120
You will find it easily.

215
00:11:39,520 --> 00:11:41,120
I still have important things to do

216
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:42,440
so I won’t accompany you.

217
00:11:50,400 --> 00:11:51,960
Purple Cloud Pavilion

218
00:11:55,680 --> 00:11:57,560
Jin Ye\NHeavenly Fate Sect Purple Division disciple\NEarly stage Soul Transformation

219
00:11:55,720 --> 00:11:56,920
Who are you ?

220
00:11:57,040 --> 00:11:57,800
Leave !

221
00:11:57,960 --> 00:12:00,200
I am Wang Lin, a new disciple of the Purple Division.

222
00:12:00,440 --> 00:12:02,680
Master instructed me to live in the Purple Cloud Pavilion.

223
00:12:02,960 --> 00:12:04,840
Scram ! Don't take a single step

224
00:12:04,960 --> 00:12:06,800
within 100 li from the Purple Cloud Pavilion !

225
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:10,160
She dares to deny

226
00:12:10,680 --> 00:12:12,640
the All-Seer's order ?

227
00:12:19,040 --> 00:12:21,080
Senior Brother, you have been away for too long.

228
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:23,800
They're trying to take your Purple Cloud Pavilion now...

229
00:12:24,440 --> 00:12:26,240
But as long as I am here,

230
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:28,520
I will not let it happen !

231
00:12:30,840 --> 00:12:32,840
Someone tried to sabotage me within the 3 trials.

232
00:12:33,760 --> 00:12:35,400
I didn't pass them

233
00:12:35,480 --> 00:12:37,240
but was still allowed into the sect.

234
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:41,040
Now, the Purple Cloud Pavilion is guarded.

235
00:12:42,920 --> 00:12:44,280
With the All-Seer's power,

236
00:12:44,760 --> 00:12:46,360
he must know all of this.

237
00:12:47,160 --> 00:12:49,240
Since he chooses to stand by and watch,

238
00:12:49,320 --> 00:12:51,440
that means he is still testing me.

239
00:12:53,640 --> 00:12:55,320
3 days later

240
00:12:55,280 --> 00:12:56,180
Elders,

241
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:57,040
it's here.

242
00:12:58,640 --> 00:13:00,280
Who dared to make a cave

243
00:13:00,680 --> 00:13:02,800
without an Elder's permission ?

244
00:13:03,440 --> 00:13:04,480
Come out now !

245
00:13:12,280 --> 00:13:14,760
We are the Purple Division's Disciplinary Elders.

246
00:13:15,040 --> 00:13:16,880
You have one incense stick of time

247
00:13:16,920 --> 00:13:18,640
to destroy this cave !

248
00:13:19,320 --> 00:13:20,440
If you don't,

249
00:13:21,080 --> 00:13:22,520
you will be punished.

250
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:34,160
Although the cave is destroyed,

251
00:13:34,160 --> 00:13:36,360
you still violated the sect's rules.

252
00:13:36,720 --> 00:13:38,440
Come with us now,

253
00:13:39,400 --> 00:13:41,120
we will decide your punishment !

254
00:13:48,040 --> 00:13:50,080
You've picked the wrong person to mess with.

255
00:13:52,640 --> 00:13:54,640
I just wanted to cultivate in peace.

256
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:57,600
But I cannot endure your provocations.

257
00:13:57,960 --> 00:13:58,640
Wang Lin !

258
00:13:59,560 --> 00:14:01,320
How dare you attack a Disciplinary Elder ?

259
00:14:07,080 --> 00:14:08,400
Seven Broken Stars !

260
00:14:14,840 --> 00:14:17,440
Grandson, stand still for your grandpa !

261
00:14:17,640 --> 00:14:18,880
If you dare to move,

262
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:20,600
I'll slice your head off !

263
00:14:22,840 --> 00:14:23,970
A madman...

264
00:14:24,080 --> 00:14:25,160
He's a madman !

265
00:14:36,680 --> 00:14:39,080
Who used to live in the Purple Cloud Pavilion ?

266
00:14:40,440 --> 00:14:41,360
1000 years ago,

267
00:14:41,800 --> 00:14:44,360
a peerless genius appeared in the Purple Division.

268
00:14:44,440 --> 00:14:45,640
His name was Sun Yun,

269
00:14:45,880 --> 00:14:47,840
he lived in the Purple Cloud Pavilion.

270
00:14:48,680 --> 00:14:50,360
100 years ago, after he betrayed the sect,

271
00:14:51,080 --> 00:14:52,640
the Purple Cloud Pavilion became vacant.

272
00:14:53,200 --> 00:14:55,400
What does this Sun Yun have to do with me ?

273
00:14:55,840 --> 00:14:56,680
Nothing.

274
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:59,680
But Master has always taken a single direct disciple

275
00:14:59,840 --> 00:15:01,640
from each one of the 7 divisions.

276
00:15:02,120 --> 00:15:04,920
They're the only ones that will receive his true teachings

277
00:15:05,640 --> 00:15:07,800
and are called the Seven Sons of Tian Yun.

278
00:15:08,520 --> 00:15:10,040
Master once said that

279
00:15:10,640 --> 00:15:12,680
the next person that lives in the Purple Cloud Pavilion

280
00:15:13,560 --> 00:15:15,520
will become a Son of Tian Yun.

281
00:15:16,720 --> 00:15:20,440
So that's why everyone's been so hostile towards me.

282
00:15:21,160 --> 00:15:22,560
I...I've told you everything,

283
00:15:22,920 --> 00:15:24,640
please spare my life !

284
00:15:29,120 --> 00:15:30,680
Since waiting here is useless,

285
00:15:31,720 --> 00:15:33,520
I will turn this place upside down

286
00:15:35,280 --> 00:15:36,720
to let everyone know

287
00:15:38,160 --> 00:15:40,440
that I am not someone to mess with.

288
00:15:44,840 --> 00:15:45,920
From now on,

289
00:15:46,440 --> 00:15:47,200
this pavilion

290
00:15:49,480 --> 00:15:51,240
Purple Forest Pavilion\NHeavenly Fate Sect\NPurple Division

291
00:15:49,160 --> 00:15:51,280
Purple Forest Pavilion

292
00:15:47,880 --> 00:15:49,440
shall be renamed Purple Forest Pavilion.

293
00:15:47,880 --> 00:15:51,200
Note: The "Lin" in "Wang Lin" is the character for "forest".

294
00:15:51,400 --> 00:15:52,280
Wang Lin...

295
00:15:52,600 --> 00:15:53,680
I'm going to...

296
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:55,600
kill you !!!

297
00:15:58,080 --> 00:16:00,520
You're just a fool that's being manipulated.

298
00:16:01,040 --> 00:16:01,640
Stop it !

299
00:16:02,720 --> 00:16:04,040
As expected, they've come.

300
00:16:05,640 --> 00:16:07,240
3 Middle stage Soul Transformation

301
00:16:07,880 --> 00:16:09,560
and 1 Late stage.

302
00:16:08,320 --> 00:16:09,720
Zhao Xinmeng\NHeavenly Fate Sect Purple Division disciple\NLate stage Soul Transformation

303
00:16:10,520 --> 00:16:11,800
Junior Brother Wang Lin,

304
00:16:12,040 --> 00:16:13,040
you just entered the sect.

305
00:16:13,520 --> 00:16:15,080
How could you have already killed Fifth Sister ?

306
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:16,720
How could you have harmed a fellow disciple ?

307
00:16:16,720 --> 00:16:17,400
Senior Brother,

308
00:16:17,440 --> 00:16:18,720
no need to waste words with him.

309
00:16:18,760 --> 00:16:20,480
I will clean up the sect for Master !

310
00:16:22,160 --> 00:16:24,040
So you're the one that interfered

311
00:16:24,240 --> 00:16:25,320
in my trials.

312
00:16:25,560 --> 00:16:27,720
You're a native from a wasted planet !

313
00:16:27,960 --> 00:16:29,400
Before you die, let me show you

314
00:16:29,720 --> 00:16:31,000
what a real spell looks like !

315
00:16:31,440 --> 00:16:32,540
Forbidden spell...

316
00:16:32,600 --> 00:16:33,880
Immortal Demonic Body !

317
00:16:38,600 --> 00:16:39,840
Die !

318
00:16:47,520 --> 00:16:48,800
Demonic Finger !

319
00:16:54,320 --> 00:16:55,640
How could he

320
00:16:56,040 --> 00:16:58,040
possess such a spell ?!

321
00:17:00,120 --> 00:17:01,720
What an overbearing finger spell.

322
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:04,720
He's just an arrogant Junior that shows no respect for Elders !

323
00:17:09,640 --> 00:17:10,560
God Slaying Chariot !

324
00:17:12,640 --> 00:17:14,320
I just entered the sect

325
00:17:14,360 --> 00:17:16,040
but I've encountered so many obstacles.

326
00:17:16,720 --> 00:17:18,360
This is not a coincidence.

327
00:17:19,080 --> 00:17:21,600
The only one who could orchestrate disciples and Elders

328
00:17:21,840 --> 00:17:23,080
so seamlessly

329
00:17:23,440 --> 00:17:25,600
Senior Brother, that's you.

330
00:17:26,960 --> 00:17:30,640
Is Senior Brother worried that I'll become one of the Seven Sons of Tian Yun ?

331
00:17:30,760 --> 00:17:33,040
Is that why you're doing all this ?

332
00:17:34,360 --> 00:17:36,000
Don't spout nonsense !

333
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:47,880
What the hell is this thing !?

334
00:17:49,680 --> 00:17:51,880
What a formidable Heavenly Beast !

335
00:18:07,680 --> 00:18:09,400
Greetings, Master.

336
00:18:09,560 --> 00:18:12,440
When I saw you on planet Suzaku back then,

337
00:18:13,360 --> 00:18:16,600
I said I'd take you as an honorary disciple for 100 years.

338
00:18:17,360 --> 00:18:19,560
But now, I have changed my mind.

339
00:18:20,760 --> 00:18:23,000
Are you willing to become my disciple

340
00:18:23,040 --> 00:18:25,320
to cultivate the great Dao of the heavens ?

341
00:18:25,440 --> 00:18:29,360
Will you become the direct disciple of the Purple Division ?

342
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:34,080
Disciple Wang Lin

343
00:18:34,160 --> 00:18:35,240
pays respects to Master.

344
00:18:55,480 --> 00:18:56,520
Good.

345
00:18:58,320 --> 00:19:00,760
You must have had a demonic cultivator beside you

346
00:19:01,760 --> 00:19:04,720
which has tainted you with his demonic aura.

347
00:19:06,040 --> 00:19:07,680
Disciple knows someone like that

348
00:19:08,320 --> 00:19:09,840
but we've parted ways.

349
00:19:12,560 --> 00:19:13,880
It doesn't matter.

350
00:19:14,360 --> 00:19:15,640
In my eyes,

351
00:19:16,360 --> 00:19:19,000
there's no distinction between righteous, evil, immortal and demon.

352
00:19:19,040 --> 00:19:20,160
One only needs

353
00:19:20,240 --> 00:19:22,360
to follow their natural desires.

354
00:19:23,320 --> 00:19:25,000
Heavenly fate, heavenly fate !

355
00:19:25,840 --> 00:19:29,080
Everything in the world depends on fate.

356
00:19:30,080 --> 00:19:32,200
As long as you have a Dao Heart,

357
00:19:32,240 --> 00:19:35,160
you can cultivate any of the infinite Daos that exist.

358
00:19:36,240 --> 00:19:38,040
Disciple will remember your teachings.

359
00:19:38,160 --> 00:19:41,200
I will celebrate my birthday in 3 months.

360
00:19:41,680 --> 00:19:45,720
I will take the opportunity to announce I accepted you as my disciple.

361
00:19:46,440 --> 00:19:48,280
Get ready.

362
00:19:50,120 --> 00:19:52,840
The cultivators of planet Tian Yun have profound cultivation and spells...

363
00:19:52,880 --> 00:19:55,120
The relations in the sect are complex...

364
00:19:55,640 --> 00:19:58,560
It's far more dangerous than Suzaku.

365
00:19:58,840 --> 00:20:01,160
Even though the All-Seer has accepted me as his disciple,

366
00:20:01,680 --> 00:20:03,320
I must not let my guard down

367
00:20:04,040 --> 00:20:05,720
against the Purple Division.

368
00:20:15,200 --> 00:20:20,840
I've been walking this path for endless years

369
00:20:17,500 --> 00:20:20,840
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

370
00:20:21,480 --> 00:20:26,440
Is it the compass of fate

371
00:20:23,320 --> 00:20:26,440
that wrote this outcome for us ?

372
00:20:26,600 --> 00:20:32,360
The heavens want to erase your existence,

373
00:20:32,480 --> 00:20:38,080
that's the obsession guiding me.

374
00:20:38,360 --> 00:20:43,680
Is this the path to uncover

375
00:20:40,240 --> 00:20:43,680
truths from falsehoods ?

376
00:20:43,960 --> 00:20:49,280
In a world of murk and shadow,

377
00:20:45,860 --> 00:20:49,280
only the flame of truth can light the way.

378
00:20:49,320 --> 00:20:55,000
Look at them all,

379
00:20:52,200 --> 00:20:55,000
being carried by the waves.

380
00:20:55,440 --> 00:20:59,640
Look at them all,

381
00:20:57,600 --> 00:20:59,640
being drowned.

382
00:20:59,720 --> 00:21:02,960
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

383
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:06,040
I will let the world refine my soul.

384
00:21:06,170 --> 00:21:11,600
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

385
00:21:07,860 --> 00:21:11,600
I will fight.

386
00:21:11,600 --> 00:21:14,720
I'll break through the abyss of despair

387
00:21:14,720 --> 00:21:17,760
to finally learn who I really am.

388
00:21:17,760 --> 00:21:23,120
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

389
00:21:19,640 --> 00:21:23,120
I embrace this obsession.

390
00:21:23,120 --> 00:21:26,080
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

391
00:21:26,080 --> 00:21:28,880
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

392
00:21:28,880 --> 00:21:34,360
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

393
00:21:30,920 --> 00:21:34,360
I'll still fight.

394
00:21:34,560 --> 00:21:37,720
It's hard to avoid loneliness

395
00:21:37,720 --> 00:21:40,760
when you are above everyone else.

396
00:21:40,760 --> 00:21:46,440
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

397
00:21:43,080 --> 00:21:46,440
be afraid of a firefly ?
